      "body": "Update 1: **Re: University Monday 2022/03/21** / 2022/03/24\r\n\r\n1.1 To make things clearer attached pics show Admin view of members and Member (not Admin) view of members. See member_only_group_members_view.png and admin_group_members_view.png\r\n\r\n1.2 The attached images also show how to handle FERPA for Admins and Members. See member_only_group_members_view.png and admin_group_members_view.png. I think it is better to just replace a FERPA member's name with *s.\r\n\r\n1.3 See member_only_group_home_panel.png for how we should let a member get to the member list panel. I think the member profile picture create/edit etc can go below the link in the image. \"Groups profile picture\". See also 1.4 below.\r\n\r\n\r\n![member_only_group_home_panel](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/5978121/159856797-2dba7115-6c6c-426b-847c-7dcebfda6b03.png)\r\n![admin_group_members_view](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/5978121/159856811-717996dc-28b2-437a-831b-06ba1cce8299.png)\r\n![member_only_group_members_view](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/5978121/159856815-57a81e56-cb17-4e49-850f-784dc541025e.png)\r\n\r\n",
